<h3><u>Amma baar baar</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Amma baar baar</u></strong></p>

<p>Zindane Shaam me jaha, bibi ka hai mazar</p>

<p>Raato ko dhimi dhimi si aati hai ek pukar</p>

<p>Kano se mere khoon x2</p>

<p>Abhi bhi tapakta hai, amma baar baar x3</p>

<p>Amma baar baar gala mera dookhta hai amma baar baar</p>

<p>Uthti hai jab bhi aap x2</p>

<p>Mera saas rukta hai, amma baar baar</p>

<p>Haa, amma baar baar.</p>

<p>Soyi nahi hoo shaame gariba ke baad main</p>

<p>Ab kya jiungi shaam ke zindan ke baad main</p>

<p>Be aas ab hoon shahe shahida ke baad main</p>

<p>Saya azal ka amma mere sath chalta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar.</p>

<p>Kano ka khoon aankhon ke aansu se mil gaya</p>

<p>Har zakhm phool banke badan par hai khil gaya</p>

<p>Baba ko dhoond laoon ke seenese dil gaya</p>

<p>Be jaan mere jism main kyun dil dharakta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar.</p>

<p>Ay amma jab se baba se main door ho gayi</p>

<p>Ye zindagi mere liye naasoor ho gayi</p>

<p>Par kya karoon naseeb se majboor ho gayi</p>

<p>Hijre padar se seene me ek dard uthta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar..</p>

<p>Kante pare hai halq main ay amma pyaas se</p>

<p>Darti hoon jhonka guzre hawa ka jo paas se</p>

<p>Neend urgayi hai aankhon se khawfo hiras se</p>

<p>Rone pe mere shimr layeen kyun jhirakta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar</p>

<p>Asgar ke bad paan piyoo main nahi nahi</p>

<p>Ammu ke baad zinda rahoon main nahi nahi</p>

<p>Fariyaad kuch shaki se karoon main nahi nahi</p>

<p>Paan main ab se chehraye asgar jhalakta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar..</p>

<p>Lagta hai qaid jan se rihayi qarib hai</p>

<p>Ai amma jano tum se rihayi qarib hai</p>

<p>Ab mout mujhko kabr ke laayi qarib hai</p>

<p>Daman to jal chuka hai mera dil sulagta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar..</p>

<p>Kounain mai ye kaisa hai qanoon poochiye</p>

<p>Marne ke baad mujhko rihayi nahin mile</p>

<p>Ye kaisi qaid hai ke lahad bhi yahin bane</p>

<p>Qaidi kabhi to qaid se ghar ko palat ta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar.</p>

<p>Amma rehai paake watan tum to jaaongi</p>

<p>Sugra meri bahan ko gale se lagaaongi</p>

<p>Puchengi jab mujhe to use kya batawoongi</p>

<p>Reh reh ke ek sawal mere dil mai uthta hai</p>

<p>Amma baar baar.</p>

